                <note rend="inline" type="source">837.00/3848: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Cuba</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Welles</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-09-13T23:00:00-04:00">September 13, 1933—11
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>98. Paragraph 2 of your 238, September 12, 5 p.m. The President and I are in
                    accord that you should remain at Habana for the present as indicated by you.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
